        '<rules type="always-on"> <rule name="CLAUDE" path="/Users/miguelgarglez/.claude/CLAUDE.md…',
      text: '<rules type="always-on">\n<rule name="CLAUDE" path="/Users/miguelgarglez/.claude/CLAUDE.md">\n@RTK.md\n\n</rule>\n\n<rule name="global_rules" path="/Users/miguelgarglez/.codeium/windsurf/memories/global_rules.md">\n\n</rule>\n\n<rule name="AGENTS" path="/Users/miguelgarglez/.config/devin/AGENTS.md">\n# Global rules\n\n- Tienes mi permiso explícito y permanente para lanzar subagentes (`run_subagent`) cuando lo consideres útil, sin preguntarme antes. Esto incluye los pasos de delegación y revisión de poteto-mode (Feature, arena, architect, interrogate, swarm).\n- Usa `subagent_explore` para investigar y leer código, y `subagent_general` solo cuando el subagente tenga que escribir código o ejecutar comandos con efectos. `subagent_general` corre en mi mismo modelo y cuesta como una sesión extra, así que no lo multipliques sin motivo.\n- Revisa siempre el trabajo de cada subagente y resúmelo tú; no me pases su salida tal cual.\n\n</rule>\n\n<rule name="pstack-models" path="/Users/miguelgarglez/.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc">\n# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.\n# `inherit-parent` or `auto` as a value: the role runs on the parent chat model (omit Task `model`). Alias entries in a panel list still count toward its fan-out.\n# budget: medium (high)\nfeature, refactoring: grok-4.7-high\nbug-fix: grok-4.7-high\nperf-issue: grok-4.7-high\nhillclimb: grok-4.7-high\njudgment and prose: claude-sonnet-5-5-high\nhardest tasks: claude-sonnet-5-5-high\nhow explorer: grok-4.7-high\nhow explainer: claude-sonnet-5-5-high\nwhy investigators: grok-4.7-high\nwhy synthesizer: claude-sonnet-5-5-high\nreflect tooling: grok-4.7-high\nreflect judgment, divergent, synthesizer: claude-sonnet-5-5-high\narena runners: claude-sonnet-5-5-high, grok-4.7-high\narena cross-judge pool: claude-sonnet-5-5-high, grok-4.7-high\nswarm workers: grok-4.7-high\narchitect runners: claude-sonnet-5-5-high, grok-4.7-high\ninterrogate reviewers: claude-sonnet-5-5-high, grok-4.7-high\n</rule>\n</rules>',
