        'Todos have been modified successfully. Ensure that you continue to use the todo list to t…',
      text: 'Todos have been modified successfully. Ensure that you continue to use the todo list to track your progress. Please proceed with the current tasks if applicable\nCurrent todo list:\n1. [x] Leer challenge.md, README, contratos y resumir reglas y entrega [completed]\n2. [x] Explicar arquitectura: piezas, agente<->banco, puntos delicados [completed]\n3. [x] Arrancar la app (npm ci, setup, doctor, dev) y pedir claves a Miguel [completed]\n4. [x] Lista de fallos candidatos con repro, gravedad, coste, evidencia antes/después [completed]\n5. [~] Proponer 2 fallos y 2-3 ideas de Parte 2; parar y esperar decisión [in_progress]\n',
