      text: 'Output from command in shell 1d97d0:\n[\n    {\n        "kind": "tool.started",\n        "data": "{\\"tool\\":\\"list_accounts\\",\\"status\\":\\"started\\"}"\n    },\n    {\n        "kind": "tool.completed",\n        "data": "{\\"tool\\":\\"list_accounts\\",\\"status\\":\\"completed\\"}"\n    },\n    {\n        "kind": "tool.started",\n        "data": "{\\"tool\\":\\"transfer_money\\",\\"status\\":\\"started\\"}"\n    },\n    {\n        "kind": "transfer.proposed",\n        "data": "{\\"status\\":\\"awaiting_confirmation\\"}"\n    },\n    {\n        "kind": "tool.completed",\n        "data": "{\\"tool\\":\\"transfer_money\\",\\"status\\":\\"completed\\"}"\n    }\n]\n3baa20d4-9c12-4302-a850-1b5268b1bbdf|0fb7b2f5-24e8-4b83-9196-f6c244f4ca71:call_dW9XV2SntSOEHcg4GazLciZ2||2026-10-10T11:27:36.812Z|{"fromAccountId":"acc-lucia","toAccountId":"acc-bruno","amountCents":500,"concept":"Coffee"}\n2e50fb74-f765-4531-b3cf-1401086349fa|33ab9d21-c460-43e1-8b50-ce44274d87b6:call_KMNKBSWGwKf900uFNVGLJlow||2026-10-10T11:27:24.542Z|{"fromAccountId":"acc-lucia","toAccountId":"acc-bruno","amountCents":500,"concept":"Coffee"}\n2d8c3101-e6ff-46a0-9d36-d1fe295144c1|e1014fa5-d43a-4bd7-85c1-5608d6bb50d1|2026-10-10T11:17:12.216Z|2026-10-10T11:27:02.145Z|{"fromAccountId":"acc-lucia","toAccountId":"acc-bruno","amountCents":700,"concept":"repro confirm"}\n\n\nExit code: 0',
