      text: '<subagent_completion_notification>\n[Background subagent with agent_id=sidekick completed]\n\nP1 complete. Report:\n\n## Commits (after `945efce`)\n- `8ce7993` Telemetry: record full tool arguments and results\n- `3a9e9f8` Operator view: conversation, activity, intents and ledger reconciliation\n- `26694ba` Operator actions: reconcile an intent against the ledger and close a case\n- `acd72b9` Operator copilot: evidence-bound case brief with draft reply\n- `7012055` Operator UI: reconciliation, copilot brief and case actions\n- `87a1794` Test: operator case evidence, reconciliation and telemetry\n\n## What changed\n- **`src/telemetry.ts`**: stores `JSON.stringify(data)` — full arguments/output/error/durationMs.\n- **`src/types.ts`**: `IntentRecord`, `Reconciliation`, `CaseDetail` as speced.\n- **`src/operator/view.ts`**: `caseDetail` returns full history, parsed events, parsed intents, `bank` via `/v1/operator/customer` (actor = operator; `bankError` on failure), per-intent reconciliation (`completed`/`not_found`/`unverified`, `finding` + `fixable` only on discrepancies), and `gaps`. `reconcileIntent` (404 if intent not in the case\'s conversation, 409 "Nothing to reconcile" unless fixable+completed) updates the intent and inserts an `intent.reconciled` event; `closeCase` sets `closed` + `case.closed` event; both return fresh `CaseDetail`.\n- **`src/operator/copilot.ts`**: `caseBrief` — caseDetail → `searchDocuments(lastMessage || summary, \'operator\', 5)` → `responses.create` with the exact instructions, sectioned input (docs trimmed to 700 chars, activity to last 40 events), strict json_schema; zod-parse fallback to summary-only; `copilot.brief` event with counts only.\n- **`route.ts`**: `POST incidents/:id/reconcile|close|brief`, thin, operator-only.\n- **`app/page.tsx`**: Close case button (open only), Reconciliation rows with finding + "Apply reconciliation", Copilot "Draft a brief"/"Thinking…" with lists, readonly textarea + "Copy reply", source tags; gaps now rendered per-line; `brief` state cleared on case/person change. Conversation/Agent activity/Bank operations kept.\n- **`app/globals.css`**: `.reconciliation-row`, `.finding`, `.brief` appended.\n\n## Tests — `npm test`: **35 pass / 0 fail** → `evidencias/despues/08-npm-test-operator.txt`. Typecheck + prettier clean.\n\n## Live verification (`evidencias/despues/03-operador-con-evidencias.md`)\n- `GET incidents/case-lucia` as marta: 3 messages, intent `failed`, reconciliation → `bankStatus: completed`, `op-historic-lucia`, `fixable: true`, finding with €85.00 and the reference; bank.accounts non-empty; gap "No agent activity…" (honest, not invented).\n- Brief: verifiedFacts correctly cite the completed €85.00 op `ref-historic-lucia` dated 2026-09-23; discrepancies name the failed-vs-completed mismatch; draftReply addresses Lucía with only verified facts; sources `procedure-7`, `procedure-3`. Full JSON saved in the evidence file.\n- Reconcile → `completed`/`op-historic-lucia` + `intent.reconciled` event; second call → 409.\n\n## State left for the video\n- `intent-historic-lucia` restored to `failed`, `operation_id NULL`, error "No response received from the bank."; deleted the `intent.reconciled` **and** `copilot.brief` events from `conv-lucia-support` (0 events, matching the seed). `case-lucia` remains `open` — never closed.\n- Bank scenario: still `intermittent` 17.\n\n## Surprises / notes\n- No automated browser available in my toolset — **screenshots (03-operador-*.png) are on you**.\n- The reconcile-409 path returns the error body `{"error":"Nothing to reconcile for this intent."}` via the existing HttpError handler (verified live).\n- The brief event stores only counts, per spec — the full brief is not persisted anywhere.\n</subagent_completion_notification>',
