      text: 'Todos have been modified successfully. Ensure that you continue to use the todo list to track your progress. Please proceed with the current tasks if applicable\nCurrent todo list:\n1. [~] B1: resolveIntent + unknown handling (actions, dispatch, authorization, run, tools, route dashboard, view, page) + tests [in_progress]\n2. [ ] B2: server-verified confirmation code (types, authorization, tools, route, run prompt, UI) + tests [pending]\n3. [ ] B3: unreadable bank body = ambiguous (client.ts, tests/client.test.ts) [pending]\n4. [ ] B4: copilot hardening (untrusted sections, last user msg, throw on invalid, source validation, z.toJSONSchema, audit event, UI guard) [pending]\n5. [ ] B5: manual form intent reset after confirm/blocked [pending]\n6. [ ] Final verification: npm test, curl flows, chat, evidence files [pending]\n',
