      text: '<subagent_completion_notification>\n[Background subagent with agent_id=sidekick completed]\n\nDone — commit `9f2263b`, zip rebuilt. Report:\n\n## What shipped\n- **`submission/tools/build-sessions-viewer.mjs`** — dependency-free Node generator: `node build-sessions-viewer.mjs <ai-sessions-dir> <out-dir>`. Normalizes Devin (chains → lanes, thinking/tool_call/tool_result split, tool_call↔tool_result linking via `tool_call_id`, success from `chisel/tool_result_meta`, tokens, images count), Codex rollouts (developer→system, reasoning→thinking, custom_tool_call/output) and Cursor chats (assistant parts, tool-result pairing; `protobuf-text` store decodes mapped to `system` — see deviation). Emits `data/index.js` + `data/<agent>-<id>.js`, copies `src/` viewer + `vendor/d3.v7.min.js`+LICENSE, and **fails if per-kind emitted counts ≠ source counts**.\n- **`submission/ai-sessions-viewer/`** — `src/` (index.html, viewer.js, viewer.css; Spanish, Banana palette, system fonts) + generated `data/` (8.1 MB), `vendor/` d3. Features as spec\'d: global header/counter/search/legend, left panel with day timeline (7 bars, colored by agent) + grouped session list (Principal / Revisores independientes ronda 1–4 / Seguimiento), center SVG with d3.zoom, lane streets (main → sidekick → 260 `branch@N` rows, 30 px rows, 28 px step, r7/r5 nodes, `d3.linkHorizontal` links, 2 px yellow fork edges), main-lane user "chapter" markers, thinking/tool_result/system filters (links jump to next visible ancestor), right detail panel with kind/lane/time/Δt/tokens, pretty JSON args, full result text in `<pre>`, parent/child nav, "Copiar enlace" → `#session=…&node=…` deep links, `role="button" tabindex="0"` + Enter.\n- README bullets added in `submission/README.md` (exact wording per spec) and root README; usage line appended to `submission/tools/README.md`.\n\n## Verification (Playwright over `file://`)\n- **Load: 75 ms** for righteous-nest (3,483 nodes, 3,691 links, 502 fork edges, 262 lanes).\n- **0 external requests, 0 page errors.**\n- Interactions verified: sidekick `tool_call` selection → detail "llamada · subagente sidekick · 15:12 · 160 tokens"; filter toggle; search "dispatch.ts" → **69 coincidencias**; chapter click recenters; nav-child walks to the tool_call; hash deep-link works.\n- Count check passed on all 7 sessions: righteous-nest 3,483 nodes / best-account 94 / pinto-night 81 / codex 35+21 / cursor 297+155.\n- Screenshots: `submission/evidencias/despues/18-visor-sesiones-{inicio,grafo,detalle}.png` @1600×1000.\n\n## Zip\n`banana-bank-miguel-garcia-gonzalez.zip` — **57 MB** (was 54; +3 from viewer data/d3/screenshots), forbidden-path check clean.\n\n## Deviations\n- **`protobuf-text` Cursor records** (decoded store.db blobs, 153+80) aren\'t in the spec\'s role list; mapped to kind `system` labeled "bloque decodificado (store.db)" — preserved verbatim, hidden by default via the system filter.\n- **262 lanes** on righteous-nest (not ~3): the export has hundreds of `branch@N` chains; one street each per spec, so the graph is ~8k px tall — navigable via zoom/fit.\n- Fork edges are drawn as structural links from the fork node to the lane\'s first *visible* node even when the fork node itself is a hidden `system` node — otherwise no cross-lane links would render at all (every branch root is a system message).\n- Playwright\'s strict click check rejects the tiny chapter labels ("outside viewport" at fit scale ~0.009); real clicks work — verified via dispatched events.\n</subagent_completion_notification>',
